  "message_id": "MSG_0002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞班级的活动项目“联谊咖啡厅”……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞……完全没人来。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}今天都文化祭最后一天了，\n怎么还是完全没人啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞花村阳介……\n　{F1 82}的同班同学兼搭档。\n　当地百货店“JUNES”店长的儿子。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}听说很热闹哦？\n除了咱们班……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞里中千枝……\n　{F1 82}的同班同学，\n　无比热爱功夫和肉的少女。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}我还挺感兴趣的呢……联谊。\n为什么不受欢迎呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞天城雪子……\n　{F1 82}的同班同学，\n　当地老字号“天城屋旅馆”的独生女。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}我倒是觉得挺好啊。\n别处可没有休息的地方！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 05 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}待在这里不会突然被拍照，\n也没人纠缠，轻松多了。\n策划得不错嘛，花村学长！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞久慈川理世……\n　{F1 82}的学妹，１年级学生。\n　正在休业的全国知名偶像。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 05 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}要是这样，我一开始\n直接提议弄个休息区就好了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}今天接下来还有后夜祭吧？\n会搞些什么呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}听说卡拉OK可以临时上台报名哦！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 07 01 06 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}要是久慈川同学去唱，\n恐怕会聚集太多人，闹出大动静……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞白钟直斗……\n　{F1 82}的学弟，１年级学生。\n　以敏锐推理协助警方的侦探王子。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}小熊想参加～！\n继女装比赛之后，\n再拿一次冠军熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞小熊……\n　在电视内的异世界遇到的神秘生物。\n　目前寄住在阳介家的壁橱里。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}小熊长大以后，\n要成为能歌善舞的魔术师熊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:18:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0D 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}想看小熊的魔术吗？\n嗯？　怎么样？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:18:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}真是的，拿你们没办法熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:18:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 01 01 08 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}呼嘿呵～嘿！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:18:4",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}锵锵～！\n华丽王子，变～身☆\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}不就是脱了玩偶服吗。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 21 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}怎么样？　怎么样？\n老师，吓了一跳吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}吓了一跳{F5 47 02 01 02 01 07 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:21:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}早就看惯了{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:21:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}啊，嗯……{F5 47 02 01 02 01 03 01 01 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 21 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}真是的，就是这么惯着它，\n这熊家伙才会得意忘形啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 21 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}哎呀～，这就是传说中的倦怠期？\n越被冷落越热情的小熊心，\n老师真懂呢～。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 21 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}真是的～。\n老师一点都不兴奋……\n不过这才有都市男孩的气质熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0242",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:25:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0242",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞这个声音是……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:26:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 01 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}嗯……刚才那是什么？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:27:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_026",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 17 01}好像是……钟声……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:28:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_027",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 18 01}可是，不是平时的上课铃吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:29:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_028",
