  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 05 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 22 01}还有，第２个也很厉害哦。\n“音乐教室里的莫扎特眼睛会发光”！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:39:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_037",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 11 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 23 01}只是发光而已吗。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:40:0",
