  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞……。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:44:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_042",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞雪子还在继续讲……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:45:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_043",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 28 01}然后，从这里才是重点。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e000/e010_040.bf.json:46:0",
